## 📖 Usage Examples

### Basic Review
```
/send_code
def add(a, b):
    return a + b
```

### With Language
```
/python
def fibonacci(n):
    if n <= 1:
        return n
    return fibonacci(n-1) + fibonacci(n-2)
```

### Security Scan
```
/scan
import os
os.system(input("Enter command: "))
```

---

## 🛠️ Development

### Prerequisites

- Python 3.7+
- pip

### Installation

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/fiavo/code-sentinel.git
cd code-sentinel

# Install dependencies
pip install -e .

# Set environment variable
export TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN="your_token"

# Run
python -m codesentinel
```

### Project Structure

```
code-sentinel/
├── src/
│   └── code_sentinel/
│       ├── __init__.py
│       ├── __main__.py
│       ├── telegram/
│       │   └── bot.py
│       └── analyzer/
│           └── code_analyzer.py
├── pyproject.toml
└── README.md
```

